== Proof and controls

For a generic collision put `Z=P-Q`. Recovery gives `[45641]Z=0`; the two
torsion hypotheses give `[r]Z=0`. Bezout coefficients for the coprime pair
then give `Z=0`. Multiplication by 2 on `ZMod 6` is the negative control: it
has the recovery form but maps both 0 and 3 to 0.

Conjugation sends `tau` to `1-tau`, so
`conj(51-160 tau)=-109+160 tau`. Using `tau^2=tau-2`, the constant coefficient
of the product is `-5559+51200=45641` and the `tau` coefficient is
`8160+17440-25600=0`. Lean also derives both corresponding point-action
compositions and exact image order.

Closed integer arithmetic also matches the two archived subgroup residues and
their product `45641 mod r`; this is conditional on the external statement
that concrete Frobenius acts through the published eigenvalue.

