== Exact boundary

The horizontal result is a same-group control, not a conductor descent. Its
abstract `tau` still needs a concrete Frobenius bridge. The weakest vertical
obligation remains an explicit independently checkable point map plus
recovery/dual and a source composition certificate. Only then should the
project run planted scalar round trips and fully charge construction,
preprocessing, evaluation, verification, and amortization.

The producer-authored hypothesis table is not independent semantic review.
A “breakthrough” classification would require independent review of the
mathematics, concrete bridges, and complete cost claim.
